          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 422.2,
          "end": 423.96,
          "en": "because we don't need to do anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 423.96,
          "end": 425.93,
          "en": "with the action in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 425.93,
          "end": 428.04,
          "en": "But now here if we need some data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 428.04,
          "end": 430.02,
          "en": "that's attached to the action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 430.02,
          "end": 432.95,
          "en": "then we can still accept it as a parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 432.95,
          "end": 437.36,
          "en": "and use it in the reducer function in the reducer method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
